# Application DTOs

- Prefer `i-<operation>-input.dto.ts` / `i-<operation>-output.dto.ts`
- Types: `I*ApplicationInput` / `I*ApplicationOutput`
- No `*Command` types; no HTTP shapes in application DTOs
